{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"88917","name":"H10 Roma Citta","description":"This city hotel is located on a major commercial street, just a 10-minute walk from Trastevere, one of the most charming neighbourhoods famous for its narrow streets, restaurants and nightlife. Links to the public transport network can be found within a short walk from the establishment and the Trastevere train station is around 1 km away. This property was built in 2008 and has 178 rooms and 3 suites and features a rooftop seasonal pool (june through september), a gym and a Despacio Beauty Centre. It is possible to enjoy the exquisite gastronomic specialties in the on-site restaurant UnoZeroUno and excellent cocktails in the lobby bar. For meetings and conferences the hotel offers 8 meeting rooms with natural light and all the equipment needed to guarantee that events run smoothly. All accommodation units are equipped with a flat screen LCD TV with satellite channels and free Internet access. Guests can relax in the recreation center located on the attic floor with a gym, seasonal outdoor pool (from June to September), hot tub and solarium (seasonal outdoor facilities) with deck chairs and views of the Tiber River.","address":"Via Amedeo Avogadro 35, 101","city":"ROMA","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00146","lat":41.866293,"lng":12.471928,"stars":4,"chain":"H10","giataCode":"132190","phone":"+39065565215","email":"h10.roma.citta@h10hotels.com","website":"www.h10hotels.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088917/088917a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088917/088917a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088917/088917a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/088917/088917a_hb_a_009.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/